# Chat UI (examples/chat-ui)

- Streams against Nest `POST /chat` with AI SDK UI message protocol (`useChat`).
- Tool calls render as cards; destructive tools (e.g. `cancelOrder`) use Approve/Reject (`needsApproval`).
- Plain CSS, no UI component library — keep that unless the user asks otherwise.
- New Nest tools: at minimum they appear as JSON cards; optionally add empty-state suggestions, dedicated renderers, or approval UI — see `docs/lessons/04-react-frontend.md`.
- Playwright: demo mode (`?demo`) for CI; live LLM is opt-in. Nested notes: `examples/chat-ui/AGENTS.md`.
